{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "bab37489-1108-8595-91e5-a19d7d3f30ee",
  "created_at": "2025-12-15T11:15:26-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Carmela Cirelli",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:09:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:09:09-05:00",
      "duration": 29,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Denise, good morning. Um, this is Carmela Cirelli. Sorry in advance, I am going to be a little noisy, because I am practicing my accordion in the other room and I have to walk away from it. If you hear it, no way I am doing it on purpose, okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:09:38-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. I hear a little something in the background, it's actually kind of nice. What can I help you with this morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:09:53-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. So I have an old appliance, a washing machine, very old, from the basement. It does not work anymore, no way to fix it. I want to know how I get the city to haul it away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:10:15-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is it out at the curb now, or still down in the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:10:24-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Still in the basement. My husband and I, we are going to carry it up this week, but I do not want to put it outside and then get a ticket or something. So I call first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:10:45-05:00",
      "duration": 31,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Smart. So large items like washers usually aren't just taken with the regular trash. Generally you'd need to set up a special pickup for it, and there can be a fee, and sometimes they want the doors taken off or any freon handled for refrigerators. A washer is simpler. Can I get the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:11:16-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it is 213 Old Beach Road. Near Easton's Beach, on that side, you know, close to the water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:11:27-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 213 Old Beach Road. And is that your regular trash day, Monday, or a different day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:11:38-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, we get Thursday. I think Thursday. Yes, Thursday, because the recycling truck comes and I always forget and run outside in my slippers."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:11:52-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Okay, I'm pulling that up. I'll tell you honestly, the exact scheduling for bulk pickup, I'd want somebody in the division to confirm so you don't put it out on the wrong day. Let me check with them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:12:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, sure, sure. Can I wait?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:12:18-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Give me one minute, hang on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:12:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I wait. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:12:26-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks for holding, Carmela. So the person who handles the bulk items is out on a route right now. What I can do is have a supervisor call you back and walk you through the day and any fee. Would that work?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:12:50-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, that is perfect. I would like that, a supervisor to call me back, because I do not want to guess. Last time, with my neighbor, it was confusing and the thing sat on the sidewalk for a week. No way, I do not want that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:13:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. What's the best number to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:13:22-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 401-555-0172. That is my cell. If I do not answer, maybe I am playing and I do not hear it, so please leave a message."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:13:38-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll make a note. 401-555-0172, leave a message if no answer. Any time of day better for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:13:49-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "After lunch is good. Before lunch I am at the market, and then I practice. Afternoon I am home, and I will put the accordion down, I promise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:14:05-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Afternoon it is. I'll put it in the note, washing machine, 213 Old Beach Road, request for a supervisor callback about bulk pickup timing and any fee."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:14:21-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. And one more thing, should I wait to bring it up from the basement until they call?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:14:32-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd go ahead and bring it up if you like, just keep it inside, in the garage or by the door, until the supervisor tells you which day to set it out. That way nothing sits at the curb too early."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:14:56-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that makes sense. Inside until they say. Good, thank you, Denise. You are very kind."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:15:06-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Happy to help. You should hear from someone today or first thing tomorrow. Enjoy your music."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:15:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you! Sorry again for the noise. Bye bye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:15:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No apology needed. Bye now."
    }
  ],
